          <commentary>실존주의상담은 삶의 의미와 책임을 다룬다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>동기강화상담</choice_text>
          <commentary>동기강화상담이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>수용전념치료</choice_text>
          <commentary>수용전념치료는 수용과 가치 행동을 강조한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>게슈탈트상담</choice_text>
          <commentary>게슈탈트상담은 지금-여기의 자각을 강조한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
