          <commentary>토큰 경제는 토큰을 강화물로 교환한다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>행동조성법(shaping)</choice_text>
